{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0513_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "ef5f9525ab970e32febe5a145662b709027c3054b48d4aa43788ce56a1bf191e", "ja": "わかりました、{$P$}さん。\nそれじゃ、私も。行ってきますね。", "zh": "好的，{$P$}先生。\n那我这也准备去了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
